    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1752735297\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/7a92ad79b06df3e0f69d266b688cfff6.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the succubus curse, the &quot;Succubus Disease&quot; has spread. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This disease causes people to lose control of their  lust and transform into monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to confront the Disease is let the infected cum again and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Aria, was attacked by an &quot;Succubus Infected&quot; in her childhood but was saved in the nick of time by a former Exorcist Nun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten years later, she determined to rescue people, the grown-up Aria decides to become the Exorcist Nun, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stepping forward to confront the spreading Succubus Disease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d1a65e2e7e6839f38983104272b66fd6.poster.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d1a65e2e7e6839f38983104272b66fd6.webm?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d1a65e2e7e6839f38983104272b66fd6.mp4?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/2652bb4e7a01ff5665a2a460251a658d.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0Special Battles \u25a0(Battle Fuck) </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to regular enemies, players may engage in battles with special enemies known as &quot;Succubus Infected&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle with those who have lost control of their lust, they may engage in acts of rape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such situations, Aria is unable to move, and in some cases,she may even be unable to vocalize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However as a priestess Aria can use the skill &quot;Pray&quot; to perform various miracles, attacking enemies, and healing or enhancing herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the damage dealt to the infected and the number of erotic experiences in these battles result in obtaining the 'Succubus Core', which serves as materials for special equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be proactive and challenge these battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d6f7bb8225c6e395607ebb12bc9fea6a.poster.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d6f7bb8225c6e395607ebb12bc9fea6a.webm?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/d6f7bb8225c6e395607ebb12bc9fea6a.mp4?t=1752735297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Erotic Status \u25a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erotic history and status are not just a number; they also impact rewards after battles and serve events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more erotic experiences, the higher rewards, contributing to character enhancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/c25e07e265385aeedb49f55223c745cc.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Special equipment arrangement \u25a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can equip up to ten special items known as &quot;Alchemy Equipment&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting six items from the same series and equipping them triggers a set effect, further boosting stauts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/02e5b3cbcee51a304ac8817952b1a26f.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gacha System \u25a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Succubus Crystals&quot; obtained from battles with infected  serve as materials to create special equipment called &quot;Alchemy Equipment&quot; at the Alchemy Research Institute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These items come in R, SR, SSR, and LR ranks, and with good luck, players can acquire excellent equipment from the early stages. Testing both player skills and luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710010/extras/6e8a7c2fcc8cc4b5e300f51953360099.avif?t=1752735297\" width=600 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
